# Production parts for the multi-object 3MF plate deliverable,
# build/preroll-elevator-plate.3mf (scripts/plate.sh, gate.sh --check). The
# parts print SEPARATELY and assemble by hand, so the deliverable is the plate
# (N distinct objects), never the assembled STL (imports as one welded body).
# Coupons and the assembled preview are excluded.
body
lid
screw
knob
elevator
cap
